      {
        "id": 3954482867,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Planned as phase 1 of [Object save fixes and arm pricing](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/master/docs/ongoing-projects/object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing.md) (plan commit c8a28d892).\n\nBranch `19-a-saved-special-ability-without-a-command-word-is-rejected-at-load`, created from master c8a28d892, is checked out in the worktree `Luminari-Source-object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing`. No commits yet.\n\nThe plan records one effect this item does not: the pet loader treats the failed record as malformed and rejects the pet's whole object set, where the other three loaders log the record and go on.",
